    "biography": "<p>The non-Awakened green mamba: the parenthesized statistics of the Ekyelebenle entry. The book prints one powers line for both variants (reproduced here); the gamemaster decides which apply to a mundane snake.</p><p><strong>Powers:</strong> Enhanced Senses (Smell, Thermographic Vision), Immunity to Poisons, Immunity to Pathogens, Magical Resistance, Venom</p><p><strong>Weaknesses:</strong> None</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> A snake that inflicts a Light wound or worse has injected venom: 5S at 5-, 10- and 20-minute intervals (mundane or Awakened). It can spit the poison up to 5 m: if it wins an opposed Reaction Test, the target is blinded for 2D6 hours ÷ the successes of a Body Test against the poison's Damage Code; no successes, and the blinding is permanent.</p><p><em>Printed stats: B 4 · Q 6 × 2 · S 5 · C — · I 1/5 · W 3 · E 6 · R 6**; Attacks 6L biting. Running multiplier ×2; Perception 5. Cyberpirates p.154.</em></p><p><em>On the sheet: the sheet's running rate uses ×3 — use ×2 by hand; Charisma (printed —) counts as 1 on the sheet (the system's floor); Threat Rating 3 is this module's estimate (the average attribute), not the book's.</em></p>",
